@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = REPLACE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@post = 1
@room = 1
@food = 1
@entry = 1

### Bảng tin
GET {{base}}/community/posts?page=1

### Bài của tôi, gồm cả chờ duyệt
GET {{base}}/community/posts?mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bài mới không ảnh (ảnh gửi multipart images)
POST {{base}}/community/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"Bữa trưa hôm nay","foodId":{{food}}}

### Bình luận chờ duyệt
POST {{base}}/community/posts/{{post}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"Món này ngon quá"}

### Thích (DELETE cùng URL để bỏ thích)
PUT {{base}}/community/posts/{{post}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tạo phòng
POST {{base}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":1,"budget":50000}

### Vào phòng
POST {{base}}/groups/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"REPLACE_ROOM_CODE"}

### Chốt kết quả quay (xem thêm actions trong extensions.md)
POST {{base}}/groups/{{room}}/action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"spin"}

### Thêm vào kế hoạch
POST {{base}}/plans/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"foodId":{{food}},"date":"2026-11-12","meal":"lunch"}

### Xem tuần
GET {{base}}/plans/entries?from=2026-11-12&to=2026-11-18
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Xác nhận đã ăn
PATCH {{base}}/plans/entries/{{entry}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eaten":true}

### Lưu món muốn thử
PUT {{base}}/plans/wishlist/{{food}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
